# Exceptions to the image scan (spec 017). There are none.
#
# An exception is a vulnerability the scan reports and that cannot be fixed
# yet. Each entry is one line, the identifier and the day it expires, with the
# reason in a comment on the line directly above:
#
#   # Why it does not affect Kritzel, and what has to happen to remove it.
#   CVE-0000-00000 exp:YYYY-MM-DD
#
# Trivy stops honouring an entry on its expiry date, so the scan fails again
# until someone looks. Give an entry three months at most.
